        "Description": "Start as Ninja on mountain path with a Sieker smuggled on mountain path.\r\rPick up your smuggled Sieker from the briefcase and proceed down the path.\r\rDO NOT run past the glass door on the left until they&apos;ve stood up and looked away. \r\rTake ledge to pipe, then jump through bathroom window.\r\rShoot the target and jump back out the window.\r\rJump back in to drown them after the door closes.\r\rRetrace your steps to exit via mountain path, but be careful of being detected from helicopter pad.\r\rHITQUICK",
